Customize the build and packaging pipeline for Code Editor

Adds support for bundling a custom Node.js binary via CUSTOM_NODE_PATH,
includes LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY in the server package, and handles missing
git version gracefully by falling back to 'unknown'.

